{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Input-based free-kick football game. No randomness, no scripting, only pure skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score as many freekicks as you can while the AI goalkeeper and defenders try their best to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INPUT-BASED BALL TRAJECTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Strike the ball at the correct position, and direction, with just enough power (and curve if necessary) to score. The ball trajectory is fully defined by your input only.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intelligent AI goalkeepers and defenders.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your opponents will do the best they can to stop you from scoring. When you shoot, they will assert the trajectory to decide where, when, and how to intercept.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A big stadium with thousands of fans cheering.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/5008d99a130b360e8b69102de53ea2fd.avif?t=1768372594\" width=768 height=396 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >32 national teams' football kits.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realistic goal-net physics.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The net will react realistically to the ball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3047000/extras/227c867949bd73496635c0acc0586dd7.avif?t=1768372594\" width=742 height=390 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compete with your friends and other players on Steam Leaderboards.</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3047000?t=1768372594","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.s